'''Hayna''' was a [[human]] who resided in [[the galaxy]]. During the [[New Republic Era]], Hayna encountered the [[Myykian]] [[Neel]] while on [[At Achrann]].<ref name="Can't Say" />

==Biography==
Hayna was the [[Gender|daughter]] of [[Troik]] [[warlord]] [[General]] [[Strix]]. She was trained in warfare from a young age and planned to one day lead her clan in her father's place.<ref name="Hayna DB">{{Databank|hayna|Hayna}}</ref>

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Hayna was created for the [[Disney+]] live-action series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]''. The character was portrayed by [[Hala Finley]].<ref name="Can't Say" />

